{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19780","headline":"杀气不在边 · 孟郊","name":"杀气不在边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杀气不在边，凛然中国秋。\n道险不在山，平地有摧輈。\n河南又起兵，清浊俱锁流。\n岂唯私客艰，拥滞官行舟。\n况余隔晨昏，去家成阻修。\n忽然两鬓雪，同是一日愁。\n独寝夜难晓，起视星汉浮。\n凉风荡天地，日夕声飕飗。\n万物无少色，兆人皆老忧。\n长策苟未立，丈夫诚可羞。\n灵响复何事，剑鸣思戮讐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}